       "certainty": "likely",
       "reasons": [
        {
         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/sr504pc8797.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Pencil in two lines, the name above the date, separated by slashes and with the year written out. Here the UPPER panel is the upright one. Day, month and the first three figures of the year are plain. The last figure I read as a 7: its right-hand stroke rises above the small loop and comes down as the bar and diagonal of a 7, unlike the plainly round-bowled 9 two places earlier. 1909 cannot be entirely excluded."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
